      <div class="grid-tiles">
      <a class="tile tile-flip reveal" style="--d:0.0s" href="/pages/brands#david-trubridge"><div class="tile-card"><div class="tile-face tile-front"><div class="lamp" style="--lx:50%;--ly:48%"><img src="{{ 'trubridge-coral-red.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="David Trubridge Coral pendant in red" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="tile-face tile-back on-dark"><span class="mono">New Zealand</span><h3 class="tile-back-name">David Trubridge</h3><p>A New Zealand designer known for sculptural kitset pendants in bamboo plywood. The Coral and Ebb ranges can be assembled at home, or by us, priced separately.</p><span class="mono">Carried: Coral 400, Coral 600, Ebb</span><span class="link-arrow">Explore the brand <span class="ico ico-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></div><div class="tile-row stack"><h3 class="tile-name">David Trubridge</h3><span class="mono">New Zealand &middot; sculptural kitset pendants</span></div></a>
      <a class="tile tile-flip reveal" style="--d:0.08s" href="/pages/brands#innolux"><div class="tile-card"><div class="tile-face tile-front"><div class="lamp" style="--lx:38%;--ly:37%"><img src="{{ 'innolux-bulbo-interior.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Innolux Bulbo pendant in an interior" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="tile-face tile-back on-dark"><span class="mono">Finland</span><h3 class="tile-back-name">Innolux</h3><p>A Finnish lighting house (Innojok Oy) making design lamps alongside bright-light and red-light wellbeing lamps.</p><span class="mono">Carried: Alma, Bulbo, Candeo</span><span class="link-arrow">Explore the brand <span class="ico ico-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></div><div class="tile-row stack"><h3 class="tile-name">Innolux</h3><span class="mono">Finland &middot; design and wellbeing lamps</span></div></a>
      <a class="tile tile-flip reveal" style="--d:0.16s" href="/pages/brands#possoni"><div class="tile-card"><div class="tile-face tile-front"><div class="lamp" style="--lx:51%;--ly:26%"><img src="{{ 'project-leonie-hill.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Chandelier in an apartment at Leonie Hill" loading="lazy"><span class="ph" style="position:absolute;top:16px;right:16px;z-index:2;background:var(--paper);color:#8A6A2C">brand photo to come</span></div></div><div class="tile-face tile-back on-dark"><span class="mono">Italy</span><h3 class="tile-back-name">Possoni</h3><p>An Italian maker near Milan, established in 1963, producing handmade classic and contemporary chandeliers.</p><span class="mono">Carried: Classic Ambra, Classic Rosso, Cubetto 609</span><span class="link-arrow">Explore the brand <span class="ico ico-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></div><div class="tile-row stack"><h3 class="tile-name">Possoni</h3><span class="mono">Italy &middot; handmade chandeliers since 1963</span></div></a>
