      <a class="tile tile-flip reveal" style="--d:0.08s" href="/pages/brands#siru"><div class="tile-card"><div class="tile-face tile-front"><div class="lamp" style="--lx:52%;--ly:18%"><img src="{{ 'project-guok-avenue.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Pendant lights in a residence at Guok Avenue" loading="lazy"><span class="ph" style="position:absolute;top:16px;right:16px;z-index:2;background:var(--paper);color:#8A6A2C">brand photo to come</span></div></div><div class="tile-face tile-back on-dark"><span class="mono">Italy</span><h3 class="tile-back-name">Siru</h3><p>Based on the Venice Lido and founded in 1989 by Rudy Marinotto. Mouth-blown Murano glass is blown inside steel wire frames, so no two pieces are identical.</p><span class="mono">Carried: 306/5 AB, HL093/6-Rock Sv, HL180/8 PN</span><span class="link-arrow">Explore the brand <span class="ico ico-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></div><div class="tile-row stack"><h3 class="tile-name">Siru</h3><span class="mono">Italy &middot; mouth-blown Murano glass</span></div></a>
      <a class="tile tile-flip reveal" style="--d:0.16s" href="/pages/brands#swarovski-lighting"><div class="tile-card"><div class="tile-face tile-front"><div class="lamp" style="--lx:50%;--ly:30%"><img src="{{ 'swarovski-crystal-rain.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Swarovski crystal rain chandelier" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="tile-face tile-back on-dark"><span class="mono">Concept store &middot; Singapore</span><h3 class="tile-back-name">Swarovski Lighting</h3><p>Schonbek has handcrafted crystal chandeliers since 1870, alongside Crystal Palace designer collaborations. We are the exclusive Singapore partner, with a concept store inside the showroom.</p><span class="mono">Carried: Schonbek crystal chandeliers, Crystal Palace</span><span class="link-arrow">Explore the brand <span class="ico ico-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></div><div class="tile-row stack"><h3 class="tile-name">Swarovski Lighting</h3><span class="mono">Concept store &middot; crystal chandeliers</span></div></a>
